63.0 µmol). The reaction mixture was heated under reflux for 10 h. The
reaction mixture was then cooled and concentrated under diminished
pressure. The residue was diluted with CHCl3 and was successively washed
with satd aq NaHCO3, and brine, dried and concentrated. Purification by
flash column chromatography (1:1 EtOAc-Hexane) gave 9 (38 mg, 80 %) and
its β- anomer (4 mg, 9 %) as an amorphous mass. 9α [α]D +88.8 (c 0.68);
